            "text_akpyjN": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>Americrete started in a small Santa Fe Springs facility with one product and one belief: contractors deserve coatings that don't come back on them. Six decades later, we're still family-owned and still making every gallon in California.</p><p>Our formulations are used on flat roofs in Phoenix, mobile home parks in Florida, poolside decks in San Diego, and warehouse floors in the Rust Belt. Every product ships with a full technical data sheet, safety data sheet, and a warranty backed by the same people who mixed it.</p><p>Julia Pineda, marketing manager, is the third generation of the Pineda family to work in the plant. Jorge Felix, our founder's grandson, still walks the line every week.</p>",
                "width": "fit-content",
                "max_width": "none",
