            "text_TdfETf": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>We don't outsource. We don't private-label. Every product with our name on it is manufactured, tested, and packaged at our facility south of Los Angeles. That means shorter lead times, tighter quality control, and a real phone number to call when something goes wrong.</p><p>It also means our team knows the products cold. When a Premier-tier contractor calls with an application question at 3pm on a Tuesday, the person answering the phone probably helped mix that batch.</p>",
